<dialog aria-labelledby="featureTitle" id="featureDialog"><div class="dialog-inner"><div class="dialog-top"><span class="tag green">DIGITAL PRODUCT / DhakaFin services</span><button aria-label="Close preview" class="dialog-close" data-close=""><svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.75" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 5 19 19M19 5 5 19"></path></svg></button></div><h3 id="featureTitle">Product overview</h3><p id="featureDesc"></p><div class="dialog-note">Digital self-service tools are being introduced gradually. For verified tax calculations and advisory support, connect with our team. be activated and tested in a later phase.</div><div class="dialog-actions"><a class="btn btn-mint" href="{{ route('pages.show', 'services') }}" id="featurePageLink">Explore this service ↗</a><button class="btn btn-deep" data-close="">Back to website <svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.75" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12h16m-7-7 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></button></div></div></dialog>
<dialog aria-labelledby="contactTitle" id="contactDialog"><div class="dialog-inner"><div class="dialog-top"><span class="tag green">CONSULTATION / DhakaFin services</span><button aria-label="Close form" class="dialog-close" data-close=""><svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.75" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 5 19 19M19 5 5 19"></path></svg></button></div><h3 id="contactTitle">Start the conversation.</h3><p>Tell us how we can help. Your email application will open with a prepared enquiry; you can review and send it from there.</p><form id="contactForm"><div class="contact-input"><label for="contactName">Name</label><input id="contactName" placeholder="Your name" required=""/></div><div class="contact-input"><label for="contactEmail">Email</label><input id="contactEmail" placeholder="name@example.com" required="" type="email"/></div><div class="contact-input"><label for="contactMessage">What do you need?</label><textarea id="contactMessage" placeholder="Tell us a little about your request" required=""></textarea></div><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="btn btn-deep" type="submit">Prepare email enquiry <svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.75" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12h16m-7-7 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></button></div><div class="success" id="contactStatus" role="status"></div></form></div></dialog>
